#################################################################
#  ADMISSION REQUIREMENTS
#  Minimum general weighted average (GWA) to apply, per the official
#  "LSPU Admission Guidelines for the 1st Semester of AY 2026-2027"
#  (Office of the Guidance and Counseling, LSPU-LB), Annex A: List of
#  Curricular Program Offerings and GWA Requirements. This supersedes
#  the earlier, informally user-supplied grade list; all values below
#  were checked against Annex A and only Bachelor of Physical
#  Education changed (previously unlisted, now confirmed GWA 90).
#  Two college-wide conditions stated in Annex A's footnotes are
#  attached as admissionRequirementNote on the affected programs:
#  - CTE programs additionally require no grade lower than 85 in
#    English, Mathematics, and Science.
#  - CCS gives priority to applicants from the STEM and ICT/ICTS
#    Senior High School strands.
#################################################################

